        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-344 (ensure controlled execution — Service Provider &amp; Contract Management (PA-34.2).) | - operational: Logistics Coordinator review and approval gate; periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Logistics Coordinator</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
